the master artisan~
A master artisan stands at a workbench, taking the measure of every visitor.
~
   Burn scars and old cuts cover the master artisan's broad hands, and tools from
every trade hang from a scorched leather apron.  A ledger of apprentices and fees
lies open on the bench beside a row of half-finished work.  For a fee, the
artisan will train a craft or harvesting skill while the student spends a day
away from the world; type 'apprentice' to hear the terms.
~
